# PDFs, fonts and binaries are bytes: their line endings must never be converted (with core.autocrlf, Git would
# otherwise rewrite a PDF that happens to hold no zero byte, as test/fixtures/three-pages.pdf does).
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.node binary
# Shell scripts run on Linux and macOS, also when the repository was checked out on Windows.
*.sh text eol=lf
